Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,.n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's my turn to fill you guys in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we have a close call with these\Ntwin-metal dinosaur-looking creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, when we were about to crash\Nfor the night, wouldn't you know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're camped out right on top of a big,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wicked serpent thing who goes\Nby the name of Seadramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.62,0:01:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when things got intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got snatched up and Gabumon digivolved\Ninto a huge blue wolf called Garurumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky for me, Seadramon was no match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever we're in danger, our\NDigimon get bigger and help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:15.02,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Red Hot! Birdramon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.86,0:02:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, whoa, did you hear that? It seems
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be some sort of aircraft it looked
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like a big flying gear admit it my\Nalien theory is becoming more plausible
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah they hit us with an anti-gravity\Nray to make us all crooked or maybe that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sign's just crooked hey that was scary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watch it That could have\Nbeen a snake, or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Beelmon, are there\Nreally snakes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:03:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, just giant flying killer bugs\Nand other unpleasant Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now that that's\Nsettled, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's settled, and where would we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't even know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we keep moving and see if we can\Nfind any signs of intelligent life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he saying that Digimon\Nare not intelligent?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what he's saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all, but I think Tai is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to keep moving in hopes\Nof finding out where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to stay calm and stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's remember, we're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together sounds good. We can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.58,0:03:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will take teamwork,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure we'll figure out exactly\Nwhere we are and how to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in splitting up because\Nthen once somebody did figure it out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sora, open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.30,0:03:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks a lot for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving right along, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our next stop on the tour will be\Nthe forest of irrelevant road signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:03:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No pictures, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're lost and these guys are\Nmaking jokes. Hey, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My shoelace is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need new shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, new shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,telephone poles I say\Nwe follow them and see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where they lead They'll\Njust lead to trouble Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the alien saucer again And\Nit's headed for a close encounter
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, it's so hot I can feel the heat\Ncoming up through my socks Well, TK,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.40,0:04:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe you should put your shoes back on
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this hot desert air is destroying\Nmy complexion How much further is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you're worried about, Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be lucky if we\Neven survive this hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does anybody besides me see that these\Ntelephone poles have no connecting wires?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if these actually\Nare telephone poles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're some odd alien equivalent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, remember those phone\Nbooths and that streetcar? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about them? Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if\Nanybody else remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it. Doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heat has baked our brains, and we're\Nall going to end up like roasted piglets?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just remain calm, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've only been walking for two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, come here, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we'd better find some\Nshade for Joe. And quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe what\Nhappened to my favorite watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun melted the numbers right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, for somebody who hates hiking,\Nyou sure have a lot of compasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, none of them actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this dirt contains small traces of\Nmetal which could affect the compass needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I'm always late anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one weird world, and I\Ndon't like it one little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should start\Nlooking for water, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we could\Ndehydrate in all this heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're doing okay\Nfor now, aren't we? Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody please find us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.52,0:06:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've taken a soil sample,\Nmeasured the barometric pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and analyzed the relative humidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really, really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep moving along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head is baking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this goes on too much longer, I'm\Ngoing to look like a wilted salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.08,0:06:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, you wear my hat for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need it more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that yucky smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, here's a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you know why they\Ncall them sweat socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.36,0:06:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This beach would be a lot more popular\Nif it just had a couple more things,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like an ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a gentle breeze, snack\Nbar, Hong lifeguards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, I have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't think that\NI can go any faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stay positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's all pretend that it's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply adore the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too, but it's time for a reality check.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't getting any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be a good idea to turn around\Nand get out of this desert right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean before we all\Nhave a power outage?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll vote for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on for just a second, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm seeing what I think I'm\Nseeing... What is it, Tide?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a mirage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's real water. Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.62,0:07:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all we need are some lemon,\Nsugar, and some big, fat ice cubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks like a village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll find people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Shaggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they'll have hats for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water and food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry enough to eat broccoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.36,0:07:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's broccoli?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.34,0:07:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.63,0:07:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of this desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from so far away everything looks\Nso big but they're so cute and tiny
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay question who here knows where\Nwe can get a drink and just what do
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,giant digimon drink me i'm no digimon\Nmy friend sora is what's called
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a human being yes we know they look\Nfunny in spite of this they're all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually very nice. "If you are not\Na Digimon, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is great there is no way we're\Nall gonna fit into this place relax
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,joe at least the natives here are\Nfriendly oh my i would just love to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take one home and put it on my bed\Nwith all my other stuffed animals
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there she goes again do you\Nthink mimi hears the same
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things we hear i'm not sure\Nanymore Maybe she's an alien spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KK is tired and hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon, just when did you digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:09:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I met Sora, we share a\Nspecial bond, which is magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't talk like us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that how all Beelon talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's how the big ones talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I just picked it up from Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is a wonderful and kind human being,\Nand I've already learned a lot from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still don't understand\Nhow you digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolved?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.99,0:09:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it about being around\Nhuman beings that makes it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.06,0:09:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When she was in danger, a\Npower came flowing through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec. Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.82,0:09:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why she's always\Nfollowing me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of a sudden, I\Nrealized I had Digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Tai needed him, Agumon\NDigivolved to Greymon to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Garurumon did the same for Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They Digivolved for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're lucky kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zora, we're invited to\Nhave dinner with the Yokos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said they'd be willing to\Nshare their food with all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see hands if you want lemonade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.10,0:09:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Yokomon eats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a cheeseburger,\Nfries, and a shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they will be serving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:10:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps some bone with meat, lettuce\Ntopped with fish, or... Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.11,0:10:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, everybody, a fresh\Nwater fountain. Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the water here is piped in\Nfrom a spring at Miharashi Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.74,0:10:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best water in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the world, Mount Miurashi\Nwater is the best in all the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Mount Miurashi? Out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a live volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but the heat boils\Naway all the germs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken, that\Nnoise precedes an eruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cool, but I still\Ndidn't get a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water evaporated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay because the\Nlake is always full.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's all go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody pulled the plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's not panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dry as a bone. I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ty's doing a little dance for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to sound the\Nfire or bring down the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.78,0:11:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you remember that\Nflying gear we saw earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It crashed right into a hillside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the hillsides out there, the\Ngear crashes into Miharashi Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the place where\Nthe water comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.67,0:11:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water comes from a lake\Non the top of Mount Miharashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So a gear crashing into the mountain\Ncould affect our water supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't dare go up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.28,0:11:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mountain is guarded by a\Nfiery Tichimon called Meramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's hideously dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a closer look at that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say this character\NMeramon is a fiery Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, there he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He burns up everything he touches!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never comes down off the mountain, Mo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is very strange behavior for him! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm burning too hard!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.91,0:12:05.39,Sign,Sign,0,150,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}MERAMON
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.91,0:12:05.39,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.91,0:12:05.39,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Flame\N Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.91,0:12:05.39,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type\N Data
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.91,0:12:05.39,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack\N Burning Fist
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:11:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meramon is a fiery Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason he should be\Nin pain from his own flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's his nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burning, burning, burning, burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like he's out\Nof his mind with pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.18,0:12:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burning, burning, burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's coming straight\Ntoward the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody, we better\Ndecide what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him move so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already reached the\Nfoot of the mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now he's starting to enter the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.72,0:12:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay very still.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to need more\Nthan sunscreen to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move a muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn! Burn! Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Universe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.26,0:13:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, keep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the way from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's room for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you please stop squirming?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the next batch, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:13:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Yucos, I'll take care\Nof them. This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come on Everyone keep moving now\NJust follow the one in front of you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't save yourself. I can't leave\Nhere until all my friends are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll just have to come up\Nthere after you then. Hurry, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll never make it\NHey, where's Sora going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, come back
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.18,0:14:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vio, Mon, he's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, there, Mon. Leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.54,0:14:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vio! Vio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Vio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.66,0:14:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I never do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't very fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.14,0:15:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what a friend is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still in great danger, Sora. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my turn to rescue you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're really hot stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're in big trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiral Twister, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Big Red, take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that! It's that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the best you\Nhave to offer, Weakly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too big to handle. Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fireball!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be your mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can beat that monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What we need is teamwork!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give him a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a fire extinguisher!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That made him bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I suffer so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.86,0:16:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we knew why he was crying,\Nit might help to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire's not affecting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it's not heartburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this monster just has growing pains.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Growing pains?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, this is not a time to joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zara?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all in trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meramon cannot be allowed to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends need my help now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Theomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pitchybob, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegiemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be among Digivolve to rescue us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.02,0:17:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Bergamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.32,0:17:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, have a...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't turn your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon, move away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a gear. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made him crazy. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose if you had a big\Nblack gear stuck inside of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd act a little crazy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poor guy. Yay! Boom! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:18:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:19:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time I'm in danger,\NBiyomon comes to my rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I call a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.84,0:19:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bi, I was so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.24,0:19:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't begin to tell you\Nhow proud I am of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't the least bit afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I could think about was saving\Nyou because, well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meramon, why did you attack our village?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.36,0:19:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must have been awful for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you couldn't control yourself,\Nwho was controlling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing I remember\Nis being hit by that gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're just happy to see\Nthat you're back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope nothing like\Nthis ever happens again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're needed to protect Mount Miharashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Meramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.32,0:19:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May you always stay well. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please, try not to burn\Ndown our village anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.66,0:19:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just remembered you never\Ngot that dinner we promised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My tummy's ready for some action.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.56,0:20:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be polite and just eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gracious guest never\Ninsults his house cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if it's even been cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have more than enough for seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, there's probably\Na good reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, that's exactly what I\Nwas afraid you were going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It smells better than broccoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might taste better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has anybody noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We talk a lot about food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.74,0:20:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm skipping this one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't like to\Neat on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't even know what that\Nstuff is, but I'm sure I'm allergic to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so ends my biggest\Nadventure yet with B .O .M .A.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing's for certain, for being\Nso little, She sure has a huge heart
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. Do you think you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.94,0:21:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me, right now.\NYou can't see everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see everything
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold, so it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see the jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you...
